#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Today’s topic is about what teens see online. \n"
"\n"
"Teens see all kinds of things online. Some of it is interesting, some is confusing or upsetting, and some is not even real."
msgstr ""
"Isihloko sanamhlanje simalunga nento abantwana abafikisayo abayibonayo kumakhasi onxibelelwano. \n"
"\n"
"Abantwana abafikisayo babona zonke iintlobo zezinto kumakhasi onxibelelwano. Ezinye zazo zinika umdla, ezinye ziyabhidisa okanye ziyacaphukisa, kwaye ezinye aziyonyani."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Many teens come across sexual content, often without looking for it. They may feel curious, confused or uncomfortable. These feelings are normal. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Many parents feel unsure how to talk about this. That's normal too. What helps most is staying calm and talking together."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana abaninzi abafikisayo baye badibane nemixholo engesondo, rhoqo ngaphandle kokuba kokuyikhangela. Bangaziva benomdla, bebhidekile okanye bengakhululekanga. Ezi mvakalelo ziqhelekile. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Abazali abaninzi baziva bengaqinisekanga ukuba bangathetha njani malunga ngalento. Naleyo iqhelekile nayo. Eyona nto inceda kakhulu kukuhlala uzolile kwaye nithethe kunye."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_female_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how talking openly helped @data.characters.media_female_1.name and her teen connect"
msgstr "Mamela ukuba ukuthetha ngokuphandle kumncede njani u@data.characters.media_female_1.name ukuba anxulumane nomntwana wakhe ofikisayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "The other day, my son told me that a sexual video had popped up on his phone. I didn’t know what to say and I wanted to panic, but instead I listened first and we could talk. It was an uncomfortable conversation, but I'm glad we had it. Now he knows he can come to me if something online worries or confuses him."
msgstr "Kusuku oludlulileyo, unyana wam undixelela ukuba kuvele iVidiyo enomxholo wokwabelana ngesondo kwimfonomfono yakhe. Ndiye ndangazi ukuba mandithini, kwaye bendifuna nokothuka, kodwa endaweni yoko ndiye ndammamela kuqala saze saxoxa kamva. Ibiyincoko engakhululekisiyo, kodwa ndiyavuya sibenayo. Ngoku uyazi ukuba angeza kum xa kukho into kwi-internet emxhalabisayo okanye emdidayo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let’s see how @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name talks to her mother about something she saw online."
msgstr "Masibone indlela u @data.characters.f1_daughter_16.name athetha ngayo no mama wakhe ngento ayibone kwi-internet."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_male_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hey, look at this! People are saying it’s @data.characters.friend_male_1.name from our school."
msgstr "Hey, jonge lento! Abantu bathi ngu @data.characters.friend_male_1.name wase sikolweni sethu."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah… something doesn’t look right."
msgstr "Yeah… ikhona into engabonakali kakuhle."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "People can fake videos now… make it look like someone did something they didn’t do. They can even put someone’s face on a naked body."
msgstr "Abantu bayakwazi ukwenza ividiyo ezingeyonyani ngoku…benze ngathi umntu wenze into engayenzanga. Bangabeka nobuso balomntu kumzimba oze/umzimba onganxibanga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yeah. I mean, everyone has seen it already anyway."
msgstr "Ewe. Ndixela uba, wonke umntu sele eyibonile ngoku."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Okay, that makes sense. Thank you, mother."
msgstr "Kulungile, kwaye kuyevakala. Enkosi mama."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Let's think about what happened."
msgstr "Masicinge ngalento yenzekileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, staying calm helps your teen feel safe to talk."
msgstr "Ewe, ukuhlala uzolile kwenza umntwana wakho azive ekhuselekile ukuba angathetha nawe."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask simple questions"
msgstr "Buza imibuzo elula"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Exactly. Questions help your teen think about what they are seeing."
msgstr "Kunjalo kanye. Imibuzo inceda umntwana wakho acinge ngoko akubonayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about not sharing too quickly"
msgstr "Thetha ngoku nga khawulezi abelane kwa kamsinya"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Charge phones outside the bedroom"
msgstr "Tshaja ifoni ngaphandle kwigumbi lokulala"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about what to do if something happens"
msgstr "Thetha malunga nento onokuyenza ukuba kukho eyenzekayo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes. Simple, agreed rules can help teens see less of this and feel safer to ask for help.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe. Ngokulula, imithetho ekuvunyelwene ngayo inganceda abantwana abafikisayo bayibone kancinci le nto kwaye bazive bekhuselekile ukucela uncedo.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphonononga ukuba angayifaka njani ulwawulo lwabazali kunye nee filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Check in regularly"
msgstr "Jonga rhoqo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes, checking in regularly can help your teen know that you are there to support.\n"
"\n"
"Father can also explore how to add parental controls and content filters."
msgstr ""
"Ewe, ukujonga rhoqo kungakwazi ukunceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ayazi ukhona ukumxhasa.\n"
"\n"
"Utata naye angakwazi ukuphononga ukuba angafaka njani u lwawulo lwabazali kunye ne filters zomxholo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "THINK BEFORE YOU SHARE"
msgstr "CINGA PHAMBI KOKUBA WABELANE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "More tips"
msgstr "Ezinye iingcebiso"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ewe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I think so"
msgstr "Ndicinga njalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hayi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here is a short video to help you slow down before you go"
msgstr "Nali ushicilelo olufutshane elizokunceda wehlise ngaphambi kokuba uhambe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When everything feels like it is falling apart And you can't help but raise your voice When all the frustrations are beginning to start Remember that you have a choice\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"You can take pause, you can count to 10 Play a game or do something fun You can phone a friend, someone to confide in Remember you're not the only one\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more Because I really couldn't love you more"
msgstr ""
"Xa yonke into ivakala ingathi iyamoshakala Kwaye awukwazi ukuzinceda uvele unyuse ilizwi Xa zonke iinzingo ziqala Khumbula ukuba ungenza ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sehlise kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba andinakuthanda ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Yima, ungabala uyokutsho ku 10 Dlala umdlalo okanye wenze into emnandi Ungafowunela umhlobo, umntu onokumchazela ingxaki Khumbula ayinguwe wedwa\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi \n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsalaa umoya Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsalaa umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi"

